      ":question/problem": "Without using a calculator, find the exact value of\n\n$$\n2\\sin\\left(75^{\\circ}\\right)\\cos\\left(75^{\\circ}\\right)\n$$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Use the double-angle formula for sine and keep the multiplier.\n\nSet $x=75^{\\circ}$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2\\sin x\\cos x &=\\sin(2x) \\\\ &=\\sin\\left(150^{\\circ}\\right) \\\\ &=\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstitute this exact value:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2\\sin\\left(75^{\\circ}\\right)\\cos\\left(75^{\\circ}\\right)&=1\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right) \\\\ &=\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
